mbination techniques to defeat the countless bandits who threaten your cargo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/extras/80d03137184c072c0718f67ce8507e9b.poster.avif?t=1755072726\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/extras/80d03137184c072c0718f67ce8507e9b.webm?t=1755072726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745920/extras/80d03137184c072c0718f67ce8507e9b.mp4?t=1755072726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Banner<strong>\u00a0</strong>Your World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Safeguard Saga, every mission could reshape history itself. From the ashes of tragedy to the ultimate showdown in the imperial capital, each journey may thrust you into events that determine the fate of nations. Will you plant your agency's flag across all corners of the realm while navigating deadly court intrigue and brutal martial world conflicts?</p>",
